## ObjectType: Order

A commercial order placed by a customer.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| order_id | Order ID | string | Unique order code | order_id |
| customer_id | Customer ID | string | Customer reference | customer_id |
| amount | Amount | decimal | Exact order amount | amount |
| status | Status | string | Current order status | status |
| created_at | Created Date | date | Order creation date | created_at |

### Keys

Primary Keys: order_id
Display Key: order_id
Incremental Key: created_at

